<title>USA: Atlantis sees $0.40/shr gain from Winsloew.</title>
<headline>Atlantis sees $0.40/shr gain from Winsloew.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantis Plastics Inc said on Monday it would sell before year-end its 933,504 common shares of Winsloew Furniture Inc which it had held for investment purposes, back to WinsLoew for $10 per share.</p>
<p>This sale would result in an after-tax gain of about $3 million, or $0.40 per share, the company said.</p>
<p>Net cash proceeds after taxes and expenses would be about $6 million and would be applied towards general corporate uses, Atlantis said.</p>
<p>Atlantis said the stock sale was part of its previously-announced strategy to focus resources on its core plastics operations.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
